              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KellyS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have a bag of cubed watermelon so I thought I'd give this a taste test (without the bread). The watermelon makes the peanut butter really creamy and then you get a of cinnamon. Definitely interesting and strangely satisfying. I'm on a crepe fix so I'm going to try this as a filling.. will let you all know how it goes!"
